  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two gallery attendants each claim their blank frame contains the better artwork. They move the frames to capture changing real-world scenes until one sunset crosses both frames; the pair align them into a panoramic view and put the price tags away.",
